{0}

Isebtaren i sɛan azday n Synix d webhooks n Discord yezmer ad d-yettwasellek deg uselkim amaynut s usefru-ya. Rnu-t yid usefru; ur yezmir ad d-yettunefk.

Synix yettunefɣen ɣer:

{0}

Adlis-a ur yettwaferru ara, ihi ḥebseḍ-t anda i d-yellan. Synix-yettwalin awal n wawalen d webhooks Discord ahat ilaq ad tt-id-yessewḍen deg uselkim nniḍen.

